    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「にしても、大虎さんはいつごろ来るのかしらね～？　ちょっとばかし、話したいことがあったんだけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「クロのこともあるし、まさか軽音部の後輩どもに話すわけにもいかなかったし、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「アイドルはアイドルで多忙だろうし……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「大虎さんに頼みごとするしかない、って感じなのよね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「あの子なら力もあるだろうし、適材適所、って感じかしらね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「それにしても、時間指定くらいしとけばよかったわ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「あたしはこのテレビ局でいろいろプロの仕事手伝わせてもらってるからいいけどさ、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「それにしてもずっと待ってるのも癪よね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「人生は短いんだし……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「いや、でも高校生のうちに人生をまっとうしたら死んでもいい、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「くらいに考えてた自分よりかは成長したのかしらね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「なんだかんだで長生きしそうよ、あたしは」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「あっ、誰か来たみたいね。えっと、よく来たわね。大虎さん……じゃ、ないわね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「えっと……どうしてあんたがここにいるのかしらね、転校生？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「それとも『生徒会長』って呼んだほうがよかった？　ま、めんどくさいから『転校生』でいくわね、転校生」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「それで、どうして呼んでもないはずのあんたがここにいるわけ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「ふぅん……テレビ局のスタジオを使わせてもらった、そのお礼に来たって感じ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「あんたって何も考えてないように見えて意外と律儀なのね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「でも、あいにくお礼を言うべき相手はいないわよ、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「円城寺とか局の『お偉いさん』に話をつけられたらいいんでしょうけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「あたしも確認したけど、今日は出張に行ってるみたいね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「ていうか、そもそもアポ取らないといけないでしょ。あんた約束も取り付けずに来ちゃったわけ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「はぁ……そういうところは抜けてんのね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「まあいいわ。これも何かの縁ってやつ、ちょっと付き合ってもらおうじゃない」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「よからぬことを企んでるわけじゃないわよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「いや。ちょっとね……この隣のスタジオに、仮組のセットを作ってんのよね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「ほんとは大虎さんにそのセットが頑丈かどうか、試してもらおうと思ったんだけど……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「ちょうどあんたが来てくれて、助かったわ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「トミ子が年度末の『ちょっとした』イベントに向けて、いろいろと練習してるのよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「西部劇のセットを学院に建てるための予行演習……って感じ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「いちぶのセットはここから直接搬入するから、いわゆるプロトタイプ的なやつなんだけど……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「ま、話すよりも直接見てもらったほうが理解が早いわね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
